bol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLLineDetail","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLLineDetail","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLLineDetail","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"If the staff-lines element is present, the appearance of each line may be individually specified with a line-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"detail type. Staff lines are numbered from bottom to top. The print-object attribute allows lines to be hidden"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"within a staff. This is used in special situations such as a widely-spaced percussion staff where a note"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"placed below the higher line is distinct from a note placed above the lower line. Hidden staff lines are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"included when specifying clef lines and determining display-step \/ display-octave values, but are not counted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as lines for the purposes of the system-layout and staff-layout elements."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxllinedetail","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLineDetail","role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLLineDetail/!=(_:_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLineDetail\/!=(_:_:)","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxllinedetail\/!=(_:_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"!="},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}],"abstract":[],"title":"!=(_:_:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Ivor